  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerz_riot/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_d07d8934-0938-40a3-9a98-35115ec750cc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fgamerz_riot07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_b489e76c-8d04-4cc4-974f-8ee9c9a5b7c6.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cJ3bs3XxHr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_7bf6a59b-bf4a-4867-8bdf-2d31fd360227.png\" width=\"196\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Gamerz_Riot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_7f1a7c2a-b5f5-4a60-a7f4-280b1e85792b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"196\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">⛯</span></span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">連結</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">⛯</span></span></strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&url=https://toppng.com/instagram-logo-circle-PNG-free-PNG-Images_79801&psig=AOvVaw00odNRdAatiHsbge0BntMM&ust=1668095020051000&source=images&cd=vfe&ved=0CA0QjRxqFwoTCKiR_ay4ofsCFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">⮞</span></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#fbeeb8\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252foneblock-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">OneBlock Reborn</span> [數據包]</strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></span></a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">⮜</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&url=https://toppng.com/instagram-logo-circle-PNG-free-PNG-Images_79801&psig=AOvVaw00odNRdAatiHsbge0BntMM&ust=1668095020051000&source=images&cd=vfe&ved=0CA0QjRxqFwoTCKiR_ay4ofsCFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE\" alt=\"\">⮞</span><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/skyblock-horizon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">SkyBlock Horizon</span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"> [地圖]</span></a></span>&nbsp;</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">⮜</span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">在最新的 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">1.21 更新</span> 之後，OneBlock Reborn 地圖<br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">將成為一個獨立的地图生成數據包</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></pre>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>⛯<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"> </span></strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>OneBlock Reborn</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f0f\"><strong>OneBlock Reborn</strong></span> 是一個冒險地圖，它是 <strong>IJAMinecraft 的 OneBlock 地圖</strong> 的延續。在這個地圖中，你將出生在虛空上方漂浮的一塊單一的方塊上。這個方塊是無限的，你會根據不同的生物羣系經歷不同的階段。這個地圖充滿了冒險和挑戰。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>⛯ </strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">在社交媒體上展示時，請提及貢獻者。</span></strong></span></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&gt;</span></strong> 下載 OneBlock： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/oneblock-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/oneblock-reborn</a><br>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&gt;</span></strong> 下載原版 (IJAMinecraft)：<a href=\"ijaminecraft.com/map/oneblock/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> https://ijaminecraft.com/oneblock</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">⛯ </span>關於：</strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在這個地圖中，你將出生在單一的一個方塊上。這個地圖包含 15 個階段，每個階段都有不同的獨特主題。你也可以進入<span style=\"color:#f00\">下界</span>或<span style=\"color:#00f\">終界</span>。<br></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">方塊和生物會根據地圖中的階段生成。本地圖添加了方解石和凝灰岩的合成配方（請參見圖片）。OneBlock Reborn 之前名為 OneBlock Classic。</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>視頻教程</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"width:255px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rvbzk_GaeJw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:261px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7TOImSxgZts?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:262px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kmjZSxd0h1A?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>! 安裝方法 ! (單人遊戲)</strong></span></p>\n<ul style=\"font-weight:400\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">下載地圖並使用 WinRAR 或 7Z 解壓。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">解壓後，你將會得到一個資料夾。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">然後<span style=\"color:#036\"><em><strong>複製</strong>&nbsp;</em></span>或<span style=\"color:#036\"><em><strong>移動</strong>&nbsp;</em></span>該資料夾到<span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>minecraft saves</strong></span> 資料夾。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這樣<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\"><strong>OneBlock</strong></span>&nbsp;就安裝好了。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">現在你可以在<strong>&nbsp;Minecraft</strong>中享受它了。<br></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>! 安裝方法 ! (多人遊戲)</strong></span></p>\n<ul style=\"font-weight:400\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">下載地圖並使用 WinRAR 或 7Z 解壓。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">現在<em><strong>&nbsp;重命名</strong></em>&nbsp;解壓後的資料夾為\"<span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>world</strong></span>\"。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">然後，<span style=\"color:#036\"><strong><em><strong><em>上傳</em></strong>&nbsp;\"<span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>world</strong></span>\" 資料夾到你的伺服器主機</em></strong></span>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">這樣<span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">OneBlock</span></strong></span>&nbsp;就安裝在你的<strong><span style=\"color:#008000\">服務器</span></strong>上了。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">現在你可以在你的<strong>Minecraft 伺服器</strong>中享受它了。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>貢獻者 / 連結</strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/IJAMinecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>IJAMinecraft 的 YouTube 頻道。</strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fijaminecraft.com%252fmap%252foneblock%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>IJAMinecraft 的 OneBlock 項目。</strong></span></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBxC-rDu4a2SKFdDPXfVxmw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></strong></span></span></span></p>",
